		(descr "3 mm LED with 3 leads (OSRGHC3132A: 1 = red anode, 2 = common cathode, 3 = yellow-green anode), laid horizontal with the axis 2.0 mm above the board. Outer leads at +-1.27 on the row next to the body (body toward +y, flange starts 1.27 from this row), middle lead bent 2.2 mm further from the body = a triangle with 2.54 mm sides, so three LEDs fit at 5.08 mm pitch. Pads 1.5 mm so the row can sit 1.27 mm from the board edge.")
